{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migration_decision_tree", "label": "Migrations-Entscheidungsbaum", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Fuenf Migrations-Werkzeuge sehen oberflaechlich aehnlich aus; die meisten Aenderungen waehlen genau eines. Sie komponieren, aber nicht alle Kombinationen sind sinnvoll, deshalb ein expliziter Entscheidungsbaum statt einer Feature-Liste."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_defaultsadapter", "label": "defaultsAdapter (Rezept 1 - additive Evolution)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Gewaehlt, wenn ein neues Feld mit sinnvollem Default hinzukommt: kein Upcaster-Code zu schreiben oder zu testen. Ausserhalb des Scopes sind Entfernen, Umbenennen, Splitten und Typaenderungen - die gehen alle zu migratingAdapter."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratingadapter", "label": "migratingAdapter (Rezept 2 - alles Nicht-Additive)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Reine (vN) => vN+1-Upcaster komponieren in eine Chain; jeder Schritt ist einzeln typsicher und die Chain type-checkt Start- und End-Form. Zwischen-Formen erreichen onEvent nie."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migrationchain", "label": "MigrationChain", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_inmemoryschemaregistry", "label": "InMemorySchemaRegistry (Rezept 3 - Multi-Service-Koexistenz)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Nur wenn das Schema nicht einem Actor gehoert: mehrere Services schreiben auf dasselbe Topic/Journal und koennen je auf anderer Version sein. Fuer Single-Service-Single-Actor-Evolution ist MigrationChain kuerzer und braucht keine Registry-Instanz."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_validatedeventadapter", "label": "validatedEventAdapter (Rezept 4 - On-Write-Validierung)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Faengt 'falscher Typ ist durch JSON.parse an der Netzwerkgrenze geschluepft' beim Persist-Aufruf statt zur Recovery-Zeit drei Tage spaeter. Validierung auf der Write-Seite; Reads vertrauen dem Journal."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_wrapeventasenvelope", "label": "wrapEventAsEnvelope (Rezept 5 - Legacy-Journal nachruesten)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ohne Envelopes hat die Chain keine Version, auf die sie schauen kann. One-Shot-Rewrite auf Version 1; danach uebernimmt die normale Chain. Idempotent, aber auf neuen Journals verschwendete Arbeit."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migrateinmemoryjournal", "label": "migrateInMemoryJournal", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratebetweenjournals", "label": "migrateBetweenJournals", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Weg fuer eine echte Manifest-Umbenennung: vom alten Journal lesen, transformierte Kopie in ein frisches Target schreiben."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratebetweensnapshotstores", "label": "migrateBetweenSnapshotStores", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Verschluesselte Snapshots brauchen sourcePersistenceOptions UND targetPersistenceOptions - ein Re-Key-Durchlauf ist ein gewoehnlicher Grund zu migrieren, Quelle und Target halten also regelmaessig verschiedene Keyrings. Ein weggelassenes targetPersistenceOptions faellt still auf mode 'none' zurueck und legt den Snapshot als Klartext ab."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_sequence_number_is_a_reference", "label": "Sequenznummer ist eine Referenz, keine Ordnungszahl", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Snapshot, Read-Side-Offset und Projektions-Cursor benennen (persistenceId, sequenceNr). Ein Umnummerieren des ueberlebenden Endes loest sie alle gleichzeitig - und scheitert nicht laut: die Recovery faltet ein spaeteres Ende auf einen frueheren Zustand und der Actor bedient Commands aus einem Zustand, den es nie gab."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_raisecompactionmark", "label": "Journal.raiseCompactionMark", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein fremdes Target ohne diese Methode laesst die Kopie mit CompactedSourceError fehlschlagen, statt den Stream umzunummerieren - mehr kann ein Target, das keine Marke festhalten kann, ehrlicherweise nicht anbieten."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_compactedsourceerror", "label": "CompactedSourceError", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_manifest_rename_prohibition", "label": "Manifest-Umbenennung bricht jeden historischen Eintrag", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Der Manifest-String ist die Identitaet des Event-Typs ueber die Lebensdauer des Journals. Wer wirklich umbenennen muss, schreibt ein neues Manifest bei Version 1 und laesst einen Bulk-Migrator die alten Events als neue Envelopes verpacken."}, {"id": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_journal_before_snapshots_ordering", "label": "Erst das Journal kopieren, dann die Snapshots", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Ein Snapshot wird auf der Sequenznummer geschrieben, die er bereits hat, und bedeutet nur gegenueber einem gleich nummerierten Journal etwas."}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migration_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_defaultsadapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migration_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratingadapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migration_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_inmemoryschemaregistry", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migration_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_validatedeventadapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migration_decision_tree", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_wrapeventasenvelope", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratingadapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migrationchain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_inmemoryschemaregistry", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migrationchain", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_validatedeventadapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_defaultsadapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_validatedeventadapter", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratingadapter", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_wrapeventasenvelope", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migrateinmemoryjournal", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/src/content/docs/de/persistence/migration/recipes.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_migratebetweenjournals", "target": "docs_src_content_docs_de_persistence_migration_recipes_raisecompactionmark", "relation": "references", "confidence": "